    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Hanoch est seul sur une plage d\u00e9serte d\u2019un petit village des Landes. Au loin, Isra\u00ebl, son pays, qu\u2019il a quitt\u00e9 pour une raison myst\u00e9rieuse. Quelques jours plus tard, une jeune femme le retrouve inconscient sur le rivage. Personne ne parvient \u00e0 savoir qui il est. L\u2019inspecteur Ruben Vardi est sur le point de prendre sa retraite : pas question de se charger de cette affaire. Mais des faits \u00e9tranges le d\u00e9cident \u00e0 changer d\u2019avis\u2026",
        "english": "Hanoch is alone on the deserted beach of a small village in the Lances, far from Israel, his homeland, which he left for mysterious reasons. A few days later, a young woman finds him unconscious on the shore. No one can work out who he is. Inspector Ruben Vardi is about to retire: it's out of the question that he should take charge of this case. But strange events make him change his mind."
